---
/**
 * The mandated POPIA wording. Used wherever POPIA appears.
 * Never claim ATS makes a business "POPIA compliant".
 */
interface Props {
  class?: string;
}
const { class: className = '' } = Astro.props;
---

<aside class={`rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-soft p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 ${className}`}>
  <strong class="font-bold text-ink">A note on POPIA.</strong> The IT controls we implement are only one part of POPIA
  compliance. No service makes a business “POPIA compliant” on its own — we provide
  <em>POPIA-ready IT controls</em> and document them for you. Legal advice comes from an attorney.
</aside>
